WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.100
This Christmas, let Dakota Rayne
bring a little extra magic

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:06.400
to your festive season.

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:09.700
[“Jingle Bells (Dakota’s Christmas Ride)” plays]

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:13.000
From familiar favourites
to brand-new Christmas music,

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.900
there’s something for every festive moment.

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:20.800
Whether you’re decorating the tree,
celebrating with friends,

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:24.600
or simply enjoying a little
Christmas magic at home,

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:27.600
make Dakota part of your celebrations.

00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:30.800
[Country Christmas music continues]

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:34.800
Join Dakota Rayne this Christmas,

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:40.000
including her brand-new single,
“Santa, Look Away”.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.800
[“Santa, Look Away” plays]

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:49.000
Listen now on your favourite music platform.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:51.000
[Music fades]
